 its position vector:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v & =\\frac{\\text{d}r}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}x}{\\text{d}t},\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}t}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t),\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the velocity when $t=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ we substitute into the above:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-(\\frac{\\pi }{2})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}),1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0-(\\frac{\\pi }{2})(1),1+(0)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040567/state.json" "file_sha256" "aa7bd7c741e5c3deb397050d8b46a3549627aaed0824252feb040909ac051c8f"} {"question" "q-51321" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040567/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "972600df0dffcfaef07aafeba28ce4b275ca8b2195529bf6eb8b68c636aa406a"} {"question" "q-51321" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14040567/state.json" "file_sha256" "aa7bd7c741e5c3deb397050d8b46a3549627aaed0824252feb040909ac051c8f"} {"question" "q-51321" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "v(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=⟨-\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\,1⟩"] ["math" "v(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=⟨-\\pi ,\\,1⟩"] ["math" "v(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=⟨0,\\,0⟩"] ["math" "v(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=⟨1,\\,-1⟩"] ["math" "v(\\frac{\\pi }{2})=⟨\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\,1⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mat